{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[About Game]</strong>  <br>The world's rifts began at the 'Primal Gate'. And now, the journey of the last being capable of purifying that gate begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aLittle Gods of the Abyss\u300b is a 3D platformer adventure game set in a corrupted world. The player becomes Nia, a little god with the special ability to mend and restore gates, embarking on a journey across a ruined and twisted world to purify the Primal Gate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044410/extras/cbc91a0e39073c83a0f765e18877a256.poster.avif?t=1775728841\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044410/extras/cbc91a0e39073c83a0f765e18877a256.webm?t=1775728841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044410/extras/cbc91a0e39073c83a0f765e18877a256.mp4?t=1775728841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is already covered in rifts. Life has stopped, emotions are twisted, and space has lost its original form. Passing through silent forests, lifeless ruins, and geometrically distorted places, the player does not simply move forward, but directly experiences how broken the world has become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nia's journey is not a simple exploration. It is a process of reversing the severed flow, reopening closed gates, and restoring the lost balance. And at the center of it all lies the power of music that will set this world in motion again. During the journey, the player gathers healing stars filled with music to activate closed gates and advance deeper toward the Primal Gate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world that is beautiful yet unsettling, quiet yet unfamiliar, the narrative\u2014conveyed through symbols and atmosphere rather than words\u2014stimulates the player's senses and imagination, leaving a lasting resonance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the gate closes, the world stops. Now, with the last hope, Nia, head toward the truth beyond the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>[Game Features]</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nia, the Little Being Who Heals Gates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a special being capable of mending and restoring gates, and restore the ruined world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Smooth 3D Platformer Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience dense controls combining jumps, dodges, attacks, and timing-based gimmicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044410/extras/b03e393dddf158a3849fe0da269cd887.poster.avif?t=1775728841\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044410/extras/b03e393dddf158a3849fe0da269cd887.webm?t=1775728841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044410/extras/b03e393dddf158a3849fe0da269cd887.mp4?t=1775728841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Blend of Puzzles and Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze twisted spaces and find your way to continue the journey to activate the gates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044410/extras/f45595b544a80c9f1af7a7c1ba1db8bd.poster.avif?t=1775728841\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044410/extras/f45595b544a80c9f1af7a7c1ba1db8bd.webm?t=1775728841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044410/extras/f45595b544a80c9f1af7a7c1ba1db8bd.mp4?t=1775728841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intensely Atmospheric Stages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct areas such as silent forests, lifeless ruins, and geometrically distorted spaces convey unique emotions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044410/extras/8092de3a3d47dca96de0f4b774c1a65e.poster.avif?t=1775728841\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044410/extras/8092de3a3d47dca96de0f4b774c1a65e.webm?t=1775728841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044410/extras/8092de3a3d47dca96de0f4b774c1a65e.mp4?t=1775728841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World Opened by the Power of Music</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play while listening to a beautiful soundtrack. Gather singing stars to activate closed gates and restart the halted flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Narrative Conveyed Through Symbols</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather than direct explanations, the story is told through atmosphere, direction, space, and emotion.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"dce9455df652b5a641981583ce9497148232e220.jpg","localized_name":"Lu","name":"Lu","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1044410/dce9455df652b5a641981583ce9497148232e220.jpg"},{"icon":"315d07da6ab21045f20b0a5d092c98201bfd4b8f.jpg","localized_name":"Open the DOOR","name":"Open the DOOR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.st